        "TileImage": "$($repository 1312f620-bf61-4b7f-8f5c-ea4e07763a98).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47! An agent of the CIA was on a mission to go underground inside a caribbean terrorist and arms dealer group, but him and his contact was caught and captured. They have been tortured for days, and the agency cannot risk them providing the terrorists with any confidential information. Agent Smith was officially &quot;Missed in Action&quot;. Failure was never an option for him.",
